imary);"><p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">I have wired =
up <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px =
solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size=
: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">UPDATE</code> and <code clas=
s=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--b=
order-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-=
sm); color: var(--text-primary);">DELETE</code>!</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">Here is what I changed=
 across the files to make it work:</p>
<h3 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-md); font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0px =
6px;">1. <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border=
: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; fon=
t-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">storage.c</code> &amp;=
 <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px so=
lid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: =
var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">storage.h</code></h3>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">I added a new helper f=
unction called <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); =
border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5p=
x; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">update_record</c=
ode> to <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border:=
 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font=
-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">storage.c</code> and de=
clared it in the header.</p>
<ul style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-d=
irection: column; gap: 3px;">
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">It takes an <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"b=
ackground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border=
-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--tex=
t-primary);">index</code> (the Row ID) and a modified <code class=3D"mono" =
style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtl=
e); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color:=
 var(--text-primary);">Record</code>.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">It calculates the offset, uses <code class=
=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--bo=
rder-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-s=
m); color: var(--text-primary);">fseek</code> to jump exactly to that row i=
n the binary file, and overwrites it with <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"bac=
kground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-r=
adius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-=
primary);">fwrite</code>.
This is essential for modifying values <em style=3D"font-style: italic;">in=
 place</em> and for setting the tombstone (<code class=3D"mono" style=3D"ba=
ckground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-=
radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text=
-primary);">deleted =3D 1</code>).</li>
</ul>
<h3 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-md); font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0px =
6px;">2. <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border=
: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; fon=
t-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">executor.c</code> (<co=
de class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid =
var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(=
--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">execute_update</code>)</h3>
<ul style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-d=
irection: column; gap: 3px;">
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">It opens the file (<code class=3D"mono" sty=
le=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);=
 border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: va=
r(--text-primary);">r+b</code>), reads the header to find the exact array i=
ndices for the <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); =
border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5p=
x; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">SET</code> colum=
n and the <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); borde=
r: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; fo=
nt-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">WHERE</code> column.<=
/li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">It iterates over all records, and if <code =
class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var=
(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--t=
ext-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">where_condition</code> matches, it up=
dates the value array and calls <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: v=
ar(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px=
; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);"=
>update_record(..., current_record)</code> to flush the change back to disk=
.</li>
</ul>
<h3 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-md); font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0px =
6px;">3. <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border=
: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; fon=
t-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">executor.c</code> (<co=
de class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid =
var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(=
--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">execute_delete</code>)</h3>
<ul style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-d=
irection: column; gap: 3px;">
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Deletion in databases rarely shrinks the fi=
le physically. Instead, it uses "tombstones".</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">It scans the file just like update, and if =
the <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px=
 solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-siz=
e: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">where</code> condition matc=
hes, it sets <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); bo=
rder: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px;=
 font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">current_record.del=
eted =3D 1</code> and flushes it back to disk via <code class=3D"mono" styl=
e=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); =
border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var=
(--text-primary);">update_record</code>.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Because <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backg=
round: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-rad=
ius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-pr=
imary);">read_record</code> already returns <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"b=
ackground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border=
-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--tex=
t-primary);">0</code> if <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg=
-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; paddi=
ng: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">delete=
d =3D=3D 1</code>, your <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-=
raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; paddin=
g: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">SELECT<=
/code> queries will now naturally ignore these rows.</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">The CLI loop (<code cl=
ass=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(-=
-border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--tex=
t-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">run_cli</code> in <code class=3D"mono" =
style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtl=
e); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color:=
 var(--text-primary);">cli.c</code>) does not need to be changed. It is alr=
eady properly catching the commands, calling the <code class=3D"mono" style=
=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); b=
order-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(=
--text-primary);">dispatch</code> table which triggers <code class=3D"mono"=
 style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subt=
le); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color=
: var(--text-primary);">execute_update</code> or <code class=3D"mono" style=
=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); b=
order-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(=
--text-primary);">execute_delete</code>, and then printing <code class=3D"m=
ono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-=
subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); c=
olor: var(--text-primary);">execution_message.msg</code> back to the termin=
al. The CLI is fully wired!</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">You can now compile it=
 and you'll have a fully functioning persistent flat-file database (Create,=
 Read, Update, Delete). Would you like to set up a <code class=3D"mono" sty=
le=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);=
