ne-height: 1.65;">Step 2: The Page Layout (page/)</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">Goal: Format those raw=
 4KB blocks into structured pages.
Why: Implement a "Slotted Page" architecture. A page needs a header (to tra=
ck free space) and slots (to hold the actual tuples/rows).
i want to do this but what is the reason to implement pages as no external =
fragmentation is there</p></div></div></div><div class=3D"kp-turn kp-turn--=
assistant"><div class=3D"kp-thought"><button type=3D"button" class=3D"kp-th=
ought__line" aria-expanded=3D"false"><svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/s=
vg" width=3D"12" height=3D"12" viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" fill=3D"none" stroke=
