(--text-primary);">README.md</code> file in the root of your <code class=3D=
"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--borde=
r-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm);=
 color: var(--text-primary);">minidb</code> folder.</p>
<hr style=3D"border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-right-width=
: medium; border-bottom-width: medium; border-left-width: medium; border-ri=
