-right-color: currentcolor; border-bottom-color: currentcolor; border-left-=
color: currentcolor; border-image: none; margin: 12px 0px;">
<h1 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-xl); font-weight: 600; margin: 14px 0px =
8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">minidb</h1>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">A toy relational datab=
ase built from scratch to understand database internals, storage engines, a=
nd buffer pool management.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">Currently, <code class=
=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--bo=
rder-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-s=
m); color: var(--text-primary);">minidb</code> features a fully functional =
C-based SQL CLI, a custom parser, and a persistent flat-file storage engine=
.</p>
<h2 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-lg); font-weight: 600; margin: 14px 0px =
6px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Current Architecture (Version 1 - Flat File)=
</h2>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">Right now, <code class=
=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--bo=
rder-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-s=
m); color: var(--text-primary);">minidb</code> operates entirely locally vi=
a a command-line interface.</p>
<ol style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-d=
irection: column; gap: 3px;">
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;"><strong style=3D"font-weight: 600; color: v=
ar(--text-primary);">CLI / REPL (<code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: =
var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4p=
x; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);=
">cli.c</code>)</strong>: Reads raw SQL strings from standard input.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;"><strong style=3D"font-weight: 600; color: v=
ar(--text-primary);">Parser (<code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(=
--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; p=
adding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">pa=
rser.c</code>)</strong>: Tokenizes the SQL string and extracts the command =
type (<code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1=
px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-s=
ize: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">SELECT</code>, <code clas=
s=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--b=
order-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-=
sm); color: var(--text-primary);">INSERT</code>, <code class=3D"mono" style=
=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); b=
order-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(=
--text-primary);">UPDATE</code>, <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: =
var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4p=
x; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);=
">DELETE</code>), columns, values, and <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgr=
ound: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radi=
us: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-pri=
mary);">WHERE</code> clauses into a <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgroun=
d: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius:=
 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primar=
y);">table</code> struct.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;"><strong style=3D"font-weight: 600; color: v=
ar(--text-primary);">Executor (<code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: va=
r(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px;=
 padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">=
executor.c</code>)</strong>: Maps the parsed command to the correct executi=
on function. It handles the logic of matching <code class=3D"mono" style=3D=
"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); bord=
er-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--t=
ext-primary);">WHERE</code> conditions and formatting output for the termin=
al.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;"><strong style=3D"font-weight: 600; color: v=
ar(--text-primary);">Storage Engine (<code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgrou=
nd: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius=
: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-prima=
ry);">storage.c</code>)</strong>: Manages permanent disk I/O.
<ul style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-d=
irection: column; gap: 3px;">
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Tables are stored as raw binary files (e.g.=
, <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px s=
olid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size:=
 var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">cars.db</code>).</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">The file begins with a <code class=3D"mono"=
 style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subt=
le); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color=
: var(--text-primary);">Header</code> struct tracking row and column counts=
.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Records are appended sequentially as fixed-=
size structs.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;"><strong style=3D"font-weight: 600; color: v=
ar(--text-primary);">Deletions</strong> use <em style=3D"font-style: italic=
;">tombstones</em> (a <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-ra=
ised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding:=
 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">deleted =
=3D 1</code> flag is set on the record) instead of shrinking the file, allo=
wing fast O(1) in-place updates.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-md); font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0px =
6px;">Supported Features</h3>
<ul style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-d=
irection: column; gap: 3px;">
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;"><strong style=3D"font-weight: 600; color: v=
