<h2 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-lg); font-weight: 600; margin: 14px 0px =
6px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Planned Architecture (Version 2 &amp; 3)</h2=
>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">To evolve from a toy f=
ile-writer into a true database, the architecture is designed to grow botto=
m-up into a hybrid C/Go system.</p>
<h3 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-md); font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0px =
6px;">Phase 2: Page Architecture &amp; Indexing (C Engine)</h3>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">The current flat-file =
<code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px sol=
id var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: v=
ar(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">storage.c</code> will be replac=
ed by a Page-oriented design:</p>
