<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">Then, when you move to=
 <strong style=3D"font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">Step 2 (Bu=
ffer Pool)</strong>, the Buffer Pool will just create an array of <code cla=
