-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">.db</code> file into th=
em, and let your <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised)=
; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px =
5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">page.c</code> =
functions do the inserting and reading!</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">Would you like to draf=
