t-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">cfiles/include/page.h<=
/code></h3>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">This defines the 4KB m=
emory block, the header, and the slots.</p>
<div class=3D"kepler-code-block"><div class=3D"kepler-code-block__toolbar">=
<span class=3D"kepler-code-block__lang mono">c</span><button type=3D"button=
