ding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">is_d=
irty =3D true</code>.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Finally, it calls <code class=3D"mono" styl=
e=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); =
border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var=
(--text-primary);">flush_all_pages()</code> to save the repaired database b=
ack to disk.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;"><em style=3D"font-styl=
e: italic;">(This is a simplified version of the famous IBM ARIES recovery =
algorithm!).</em></p>
<h3 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-md); font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0px =
6px;">Next Up:</h3>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">We have built all the =
core primitives (<code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised)=
