 into <strong style=3D"font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);"><code=
 class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid va=
r(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--=
text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">executor.c</code></strong>.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">Instead of reading fla=
t structs from a flat file, <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(-=
-bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; pa=
dding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">exe=
cutor.c</code> will now:</p>
<ol style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-d=
irection: column; gap: 3px;">
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Generate a Transaction ID and call <code cl=
ass=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(-=
-border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--tex=
t-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">wal_write_record</code>.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Use <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgroun=
d: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius:=
 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primar=
y);">fetch_page</code> from the <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: v=
ar(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px=
; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);"=
