<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Use the <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backg=
round: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-rad=
ius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-pr=
imary);">btree</code> functions to find where to insert/read.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Call <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgrou=
nd: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius=
: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-prima=
ry);">unpin_page</code> when done.</li>
</ol>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">Shall I begin rewritin=
