<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">We have moved away fro=
m <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px s=
olid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size:=
 var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">storage.c</code> (the flat bi=
nary files).</p>
<h3 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-md); font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0px =
6px;">How the new <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised=
); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px=
 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">executor.c</c=
ode> works:</h3>
<ol style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-d=
irection: column; gap: 3px;">
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;"><strong style=3D"font-=
weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">Initialization (<code class=3D"mo=
no" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-s=
ubtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); co=
lor: var(--text-primary);">init_v2_engine</code>)</strong>:
When you run the first query, it creates/opens <code class=3D"mono" style=
=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); b=
order-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(=
--text-primary);">cars.db</code> and <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgrou=
nd: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius=
: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-prima=
ry);">cars.log</code>. It sets up the Buffer Pool and formats <code class=
=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--bo=
rder-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-s=
m); color: var(--text-primary);">Page 0</code> as the root of the B+ Tree.<=
/p>
</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;"><strong style=3D"font-=
weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);"><code class=3D"mono" style=3D"bac=
kground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-r=
adius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-=
primary);">execute_insert</code></strong>:</p>
<ul style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-d=
irection: column; gap: 3px;">
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Generates a Transaction ID.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Writes a <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"back=
ground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-ra=
dius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-p=
rimary);">LOG_BEGIN_TXN</code> to the WAL.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Calls <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgro=
und: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radiu=
s: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-prim=
ary);">fetch_page(&amp;g_pool, 0)</code> to bring the root B+ Tree page int=
o RAM.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Calls <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgro=
und: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radiu=
s: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-prim=
ary);">btree_leaf_insert()</code> to insert the primary key directly into t=
he page's sorted slots.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Writes <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgr=
ound: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radi=
us: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-pri=
mary);">LOG_INSERT</code> and <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var=
(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; =
padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">L=
OG_COMMIT_TXN</code> to the WAL, and calls <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"ba=
ckground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-=
radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text=
-primary);">wal_flush()</code> to force it to disk.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">Calls <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgro=
und: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radiu=
s: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-prim=
ary);">unpin_page(..., true)</code> to tell the Buffer Pool that this page =
is dirty and must be saved eventually.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;"><strong style=3D"font-=
weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);"><code class=3D"mono" style=3D"bac=
kground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-r=
adius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-=
primary);">execute_select</code></strong>:</p>
<ul style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-d=
irection: column; gap: 3px;">
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">If you do a <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"b=
ackground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border=
-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--tex=
t-primary);">SELECT *</code>, it fetches Page 0, reads the <code class=3D"m=
ono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-=
subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); c=
olor: var(--text-primary);">BTreeHeader</code>, and prints all the keys and=
 their <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: =
1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-=
size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">RecordID</code> pointers=
 currently sitting in that 4KB block.</li>
<li style=3D"line-height: 1.6;">If you do a <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"b=
ackground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border=
-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--tex=
t-primary);">WHERE</code> clause (e.g. <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgr=
ound: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radi=
us: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-pri=
mary);">WHERE id =3D 5</code>), it uses your <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"=
background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); borde=
r-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--te=
xt-primary);">btree_search</code> function. <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"b=
ackground: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border=
-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--tex=
t-primary);">btree_search</code> asks the Buffer Pool to traverse the tree =
page-by-page until it finds the exact <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgro=
und: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radiu=
s: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-prim=
ary);">RecordID</code>.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">You can now compile th=
is project!
Because we completely switched out the underlying engine, you will need to =
delete any old <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); =
border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5p=
x; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">.db</code> files=
 from the flat-file era before running it.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">Are you ready to move =
on to the final layer in your architecture: the <strong style=3D"font-weigh=
t: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">Go Server &amp; FFI Bridge</strong>?</=
