v style=3D"font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-primary);"><p style=3D"margin=
: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">The root cause of the error you're seein=
g isn't actually a bug in that <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: va=
r(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px;=
 padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">=
strncmp</code> block! The problem is that the database was accidentally rea=
ding old, corrupted "Version 1" flat files, which caused the memory in the =
Buffer Pool to look like gibberish. Because the <code class=3D"mono" style=
=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); b=
order-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(=
--text-primary);">is_leaf</code> flag was false, it aborted the insert enti=
rely.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">To fix this <strong st=
yle=3D"font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">permanently</strong> =
without you needing to manually delete files, I just updated <code class=3D=
"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--borde=
r-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm);=
 color: var(--text-primary);">executor.c</code>.</p>
<h3 style=3D"font-size: var(--text-md); font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0px =
6px;">What I changed:</h3>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">I changed the file ext=
ension that the V2 engine uses from <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"backgroun=
d: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius:=
 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primar=
y);">.db</code> to <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raise=
d); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1p=
x 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">.v2</code> a=
nd <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); border: 1px =
solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size=
: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">.v2.log</code>.</p>
<div class=3D"kepler-code-block"><div class=3D"kepler-code-block__toolbar">=
<span class=3D"kepler-code-block__lang mono">c</span><button type=3D"button=
" class=3D"kepler-code-block__copy" aria-label=3D"Copy code" title=3D"Copy =
