viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" fill=3D"none" stroke=3D"currentColor" stroke-width=3D=
"2" stroke-linecap=3D"round" stroke-linejoin=3D"round" class=3D"lucide luci=
de-copy" aria-hidden=3D"true"><rect width=3D"14" height=3D"14" x=3D"8" y=3D=
"8" rx=3D"2" ry=3D"2"></rect><path d=3D"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2=
-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div><pre class=3D"mono kepler=
-code-block__pre" style=3D"margin: 0px; padding: 8px 12px; font-size: var(-=
-text-sm); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-primary); background: var(-=
-bg-base); overflow: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>snprintf(db_filename, si=
zeof(db_filename), "%s.v2", db_name);</code></pre></div>
<p style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.65;">This guarantees that w=
hen you run <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-raised); bor=
der: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; =
font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">insert into users</=
code>, it creates a brand new <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var=
(--bg-raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; =
padding: 1px 5px; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-primary);">u=
sers.v2</code> file, properly formats Page 0 as a leaf node, and never acci=
dentally reads your old <code class=3D"mono" style=3D"background: var(--bg-=
raised); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; paddin=
